# Build outputs. The root .gitignore un-ignores ports/*/Makefile, so this
# directory is meant to be tracked, and without these three lines the next
# `git add ports` commits a 20MB ELF and a 3MB NRO next to the sources.
out/
build/
*.nro
*.elf
*.nacp
build.ninja
# Logs from make and from the tools this directory drives.
*.log
*.err

# gen_icon.ps1 writes icon.jpg, but the icon is part of the product rather than
# an output: it is embedded in the NRO by the build, and it is the one thing a
# change to the palette has to keep in sync, so it stays in the tree.
!icon.jpg